Version 0.9.2, January 20, 2026, 2026

Bug fixes της προηγούμενης έκδοσης 0.9.1 και διάφορες προσθήκες:

a. Now you can create a circle by specifying a chord and the corresponding central angle.
b. It is now optional to define the cutting edges in the "trim" command. If they are not
   defined by the user, all the visible elements are cutting edges. In this case,
   no elements are selected and the selection of the previous command is retained.
c. The key bindings Control-C, Control-X, Control-V, Control-F transformed to
   Control-Shift-C, Control-Shift-X, Control-Shift-V, Control-Shift-F, so that the normal copy/cut/paste
   and find commands work with the command window.
d. grayplaus now leads to '+' and grayminus to '-' in the command window.
   Shift-grayplaus now brightens images and Shift-grayminus darkens images
   Control-grayplus remains the same: zooms in 2 times, with respect to the center of the window, and
   Control-grayminus remains the same: zooms out 2 times, with respect to the center of the window
e. Now ThanCad can compute and draw a U-shape staircase - for architectural plan views.
   Command 'archstairs'.
f  Now ThanCad can draw the North symbol - for architectural plan views.
   Command 'archnorth'.

